{
  "id": "buyer-search-strict-constraints",
  "description": "Strict constraints, no results, invalid input and approved refinement for the buyer search, measured against the real LotsService over four lots copied from fixtures/auction-data/lots.json: three sold and one upcoming (only the database repository is faked; it returns lots in the lots search's documented order: newest sale first, then lot id). Each scenario's `criteria` is merged over emptyBuyerCriteria(language). `expected.request` is exactly what the buyer search sends to the lots search (null when nothing is sent); `expected.kind` is the buyer search outcome; `expected.lotIds` is the measured result order handed to the result cards; `expected.invalidFields` names the fields the lots search DTO rejected. Budgets follow the lots search price rule: a sold lot is compared by its realized price, an unsold lot by whether its estimate band overlaps the budget; amounts are compared as-is (all four lots are USD). Only the upcoming lot carries a creator, so creator filters match that lot alone.",
  "lotsSource": "fixtures/demo-scenarios/buyer-search-strict-constraints.lots.json",
  "namedLotId": "lot-kestenbaum-54554-121421",
